   "columns": [
    [
     {
      "type": "textmedia",
      "header": "<h1> Options &amp;<br/>Accessories </h1>",
      "body": "",
      "images": [],
      "videos": [],
      "pos": "text",
      "cols": 1,
      "valign": "top",
      "ftype": "text",
      "id": "c1539",
      "bg": "",
      "space": {
       "before": "default",
       "after": "default"
      }
     }
    ],
    [
     {
      "type": "accordion",
      "header": "",
      "items": [
       {
        "title": "Automatic sliding door",
        "blocks": [
         {
          "type": "textmedia",
          "header": "",
          "body": "<p>Before starting the measuring process, the sliding door of the measuring machine can be conveniently and easily closed pneumatically via the software and opened again once the measuring process is complete.</p>",
          "images": [
           {
            "src": "/fileadmin/_processed_/9/9/csm_option_schiebetuer_a5040531ed.webp",
            "alt": "",
            "w": 1000,
            "h": 563
           }
          ],
          "videos": [],
          "pos": "below",
          "cols": 1,
          "valign": "top",
          "ftype": "textpic",
          "id": "c1554",
          "bg": "",
          "space": {
           "before": "default",
           "after": "default"
          }
         }
        ]
       },
       {
        "title": "»orthoScan«",
        "blocks": [
         {
          "type": "textmedia",
          "header": "",
          "body": "<p>The swiveling »orthoScan« multi-sensor optics carrier always finds the perfect viewing angle on the tool. This means that the cutting edge geometries of tools with a pitch, such as taps or hobs, can be measured without distortion.</p>",
          "images": [
           {
            "src": "/fileadmin/_processed_/7/1/csm_option_orthoScan_26dac9eafc.webp",
            "alt": "",
            "w": 1000,
            "h": 563
           }
          ],
          "videos": [],
          "pos": "below",
          "cols": 1,
          "valign": "top",
          "ftype": "textpic",
          "id": "c1552",
          "bg": "",
          "space": {
           "before": "default",
           "after": "default"
          }
         }
        ]
       },
       {
        "title": "Tailstock counter point",
        "blocks": [
         {
          "type": "textmedia",
          "header": "",
          "body": "<p>With a clamping range of 300 mm for holding tools between centers and for measuring exclusively using the snap gauge principle. The tailstock is removable and equipped with high-precision Hirth serration as an interchangeable interface.</p>",
          "images": [
           {
            "src": "/fileadmin/_processed_/8/a/csm_option_reitstock_5c3f865d44.webp",
            "alt": "",
            "w": 1000,
            "h": 563
           }
          ],
          "videos": [],
          "pos": "below",
          "cols": 1,
          "valign": "top",
          "ftype": "textpic",
          "id": "c2378",
          "bg": "",
          "space": {
           "before": "default",
           "after": "default"
          }
         }
        ]
       },
       {
        "title": "Scanning probe",
        "blocks": [
         {
          "type": "textmedia",
          "header": "",
          "body": "<p>For electronic tactile measurement of, for example, the back flank finish on taps. Available with styli from D 0.3 mm to D 2 mm.</p>",
          "images": [
           {
            "src": "/fileadmin/_processed_/a/5/csm_option_messtaster_d8462cdf46.webp",
            "alt": "",
            "w": 1000,
            "h": 563
           }
          ],
          "videos": [],
          "pos": "below",
          "cols": 1,
          "valign": "top",
          "ftype": "textpic",
          "id": "c1550",
          "bg": "",
          "space": {
           "before": "default",
           "after": "default"
          }
         }
        ]
       },
       {
        "title": "Measuring and testing equipment",
        "blocks": [
         {
          "type": "textmedia",
          "header": "",
          "body": "<p>For periodic on-site inspection of the measuring machine and to verify the accuracy of transmitted and incident light measurements, ZOLLER offers appropriate measuring and inspection equipment for your measuring machine, such as control mandrels, diameter and angle gauges.</p>",
          "images": [
           {
            "src": "/fileadmin/_processed_/9/9/csm_option_messmittel_39f8b82e8f.webp",
            "alt": "",
            "w": 1000,
            "h": 563
           }
          ],
          "videos": [],
          "pos": "below",
          "cols": 1,
          "valign": "top",
          "ftype": "textpic",
          "id": "c1548",
          "bg": "",
          "space": {
           "before": "default",
           "after": "default"
          }
         }
        ]
       },
       {
        "title": "Security package",
        "blocks": [
         {
          "type": "textmedia",
          "header": "",
          "body": "<p>Important operating elements are located on the front of the measuring machine. This means you always have unrestricted access to the emergency stop switch, the reset button, the membrane keypad and the button for starting measuring processes.</p>",
          "images": [
           {
            "src": "/fileadmin/_processed_/3/2/csm_option_sicherheitspaket_b2fa328696.webp",
            "alt": "",
            "w": 1000,
            "h": 563
           }
          ],
          "videos": [],
          "pos": "below",
          "cols": 1,
          "valign": "top",
          "ftype": "textpic",
          "id": "c1546",
          "bg": "",
          "space": {
           "before": "default",
           "after": "default"
          }
         }
        ]
       },
       {
        "title": "Security package",
        "blocks": [
         {
          "type": "textmedia",
          "header": "",
          "body": "<p>Important operating elements are located on the front of the measuring machine. This means you always have unrestricted access to the emergency stop switch, the reset button, the membrane keypad and the button for starting measuring processes.</p>",
          "images": [
           {
            "src": "/fileadmin/_processed_/c/d/csm_option_sicherheitspaket_95153e17e4.webp",
            "alt": "",
            "w": 1000,
            "h": 563
           }
          ],
          "videos": [],
          "pos": "below",
          "cols": 1,
          "valign": "top",
          "ftype": "textpic",
          "id": "c1544",
          "bg": "",
          "space": {
           "before": "default",
           "after": "default"
          }
         }
        ]
       },
       {
        "title": "Manual RFID read/write station »mslz«",
        "blocks": [
         {
          "type": "textmedia",
          "header": "",
          "body": "<p>For manual writing/reading of the code carrier on the tool holder via a hand-held reader.</p>",
          "images": [
           {
            "src": "/fileadmin/_processed_/a/f/csm_option_rfid_34dfe1d75c.webp",
            "alt": "",
            "w": 1000,
            "h": 563
           }
          ],
          "videos": [],
          "pos": "below",
          "cols": 1,
          "valign": "top",
          "ftype": "textpic",
          "id": "c1542",
          "bg": "",
          "space": {
           "before": "default",
           "after": "default"
          }
         }
        ]
       },
       {
        "title": "UPS system",
        "blocks": [
         {
          "type": "textmedia",
          "header": "",
          "body": "<p>The UPS system for uninterruptible power supply ensures that your computer is shut down properly in the event of a power failure to prevent data loss. Mains voltages of 230 V~ (Europe) and 120 V~ (USA) are available.</p>",
          "images": [
           {
            "src": "/fileadmin/_processed_/b/2/csm_option_usv_4c4cb5d571.webp",
            "alt": "",
            "w": 1000,
            "h": 563
           }
          ],
          "videos": [],
          "pos": "below",
          "cols": 1,
          "valign": "top",
          "ftype": "textpic",
          "id": "c1540",
          "bg": "",
          "space": {
           "before": "default",
           "after": "default"
          }
         }
        ]
       }
      ],
